---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Mamoru — Dashboard" description="Positions, health, and savings status.">
  <main class="page">
    <div class="stack">
      <p class="badge" role="status">Demo / dry-run · Live LP HOLD</p>
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/">Home</a> / Dashboard</p>
      <h1 class="hero">Dashboard</h1>
      <p class="teaser">Pool positions and status. Numbers stay empty until Base deposit and gates are green. No APR or return promises.</p>
      <section class="grid" aria-label="Dashboard panels">
        <article class="card">
          <h2>Strategy status</h2>
          <p class="muted">Balanced mix illustration: 50% stablecoin · 35% BTC/ETH-stable LP · 15% high-yield.</p>
          <p class="honesty">Example mix — not a return promise.</p>
          <p class="status">Status: idle · dry-run</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2>Portfolio</h2>
          <p class="muted">Isolated agent capital. Main wallet untouched.</p>
          <p class="value">—</p>
          <p class="status">Status: not funded</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2>Positions</h2>
          <p class="muted">Uniswap LP ranges appear after dry-run and gates pass. Live LP HOLD.</p>
          <p class="value">None</p>
          <p class="status">Status: idle</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2>Accumulated USDC savings</h2>
          <p class="muted">Harvest converts pool yield to USDC. Not a savings calendar.</p>
          <p class="value">—</p>
          <p class="zero">No savings yet — harvest 0 is not a loss.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2>Savings history</h2>
          <p class="muted">Transparent record of harvests and withdrawals when live.</p>
          <p class="value">Empty</p>
          <p class="status">Status: dry-run</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h2>Actions</h2>
          <p class="muted">Pause · Withdraw capital · Withdraw savings — available after live grant.</p>
          <div class="action-row">
            <button type="button" class="btn ghost" disabled aria-disabled="true">Pause</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn ghost" disabled aria-disabled="true">Withdraw capital</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn ghost" disabled aria-disabled="true">Withdraw savings</button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
      <nav class="actions"><a class="btn ghost" href="/onboarding">Back to onboarding</a></nav>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .page { min-height: 100dvh; display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vh, 3.5rem) clamp(1rem, 5vw, 4rem) 3rem; }
  .stack { width: 100%; max-width: 52rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .badge { margin: 0; width: fit-content; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--emerald); border: 1px solid var(--wash); padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 999px; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--stone); }
  .eyebrow a { text-decoration: none; }
  .hero { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; }
  .teaser { margin: 0; color: var(--stone); line-height: 1.45; max-width: 40rem; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .card { border: 1px solid var(--wash); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 85%, transparent); padding: 1rem 1.1rem; display: grid; gap: 0.45rem; }
  .card h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 400; }
  .muted { margin: 0; color: var(--stone); font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .honesty { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--emerald); }
  .value { margin: 0.2rem 0 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .zero { margin: 0; color: var(--stone); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .status { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--stone); }
  .action-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 7rem; padding: 0.65rem 1rem; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid var(--wash); color: var(--ink); background: transparent; cursor: pointer; }
  .btn:disabled, .btn[aria-disabled="true"] { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }
</style>
